sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for ny limit.hourly 2
set-for ny quiet.start 22:00
set-for ny quiet.end 07:00
link ny busy 1 20
send d1 alice ny ttl=3h first diag message
send d2 bob ny second one
explain d1
advance 30s
explain d1
forecast ny 100
stats ny
advance 2m
timeline d1
latency
latency ny
doctor
snapshot
help forecast
help
